{
    "title": "Weather forecast: Live Radar",
    "description": "<b>Weather Forecast: Live Radar</b>\r\n\r\nStay ahead of the weather with our comprehensive <b>Weather & Temperature App</b>.\r\n\r\n- <b>Hourly Updates</b>\r\n  - Get hourly updates on hourly weather conditions.\r\n  - Plan your day with precise hourly hour-to-hour forecasts.\r\n  - Stay prepared for changing hourly weather throughout the day.\r\n\r\n- <b>Air Quality</b>\r\n  - Monitor the air quality index (AQI) in your area.\r\n  - Receive alerts for poor air quality conditions.\r\n  - Take necessary precautions for your health based on air quality information.\r\n\r\n- <b>UV Index</b>\r\n  - Track UV radiation levels throughout the day.\r\n  - Protect yourself from harmful UV exposure with real-time UV index data.\r\n  - Plan outdoor activities according to UV index forecasts.\r\n\r\n- <b>Temperature App</b>\r\n  - Check current temperature app and weather conditions.\r\n  - Get accurate temperature app forecasts for your location.\r\n  - Plan your day based on temperature app trends.\r\n\r\n- <b>Predict Wind</b>\r\n  - View predict wind speed and direction forecasts.\r\n  - Stay informed about predict wind changes.\r\n  - Plan outdoor activities with predict wind conditions.\r\n\r\n<b>Additional Features:</b>\r\n\r\n- <b>Live Radar</b>: Real-time live radar images.\r\n\r\n- <b>Rain</b>: Receive predictions on rain intensity and duration.\r\n \r\n- <b>Weather Alerts</b>: Receive severe weather alerts for your location.\r\n\r\n- <b>Weather Widget</b>: Access weather information directly from your home screen.\r\n\r\nWith \"\"<i>Weather Forecast: Live Radar</i>\"\", you can make sure to stay informed and prepared for the weather. Displaying ads supports the Weather Forecast team's ongoing enhancements. For an ad-free experience, consider upgrading to support further development!\r\n\r\nFor questions or feedback about the Weather Forecast app, please contact weatherforecastchannel@yahoo.com.",
